; ⚠️ PHASE THREE FIGHTS DIFFERENTLY, NOT JUST FASTER (2026-09-05). Every phase before this one only
; ever scaled numbers — attack speed, move speed, a hotter flare — because there was no way to give a
; boss a new move that did not mean a branch inside the generic controller. A phase can now carry its
; own attack set, so at a third of his health the Iron King stops sweeping and commits entirely: the
; sweep is gone from his menu and both remaining blows are uninterruptible.
;
; It is the same maul and the same damage. What changes is that there is no longer a safe blow to
; bait — you cannot stagger him out of anything, and the answer becomes spacing rather than trading.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="P3_Crush"]
